'''Zero Field''' (ゼロフィールド, ''Zero Fīrudo'', '''Zero Field''') is the 1st sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 99th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]] and is available up to {{2c}} difficulty.

Upon completing its only stage, the player will be able to unlock the [[True Form]] of [[Filibuster Cat X (Special Cat)|Filibuster Cat X]]. Clearing said stage and all [[Zombie Outbreaks]] causes the [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)/Outbreak|Filibuster Invasion Outbreak]] to appear in a random [[Cats of the Cosmos]] stage, which can then be cleared for a [[Legend Capsules (Gacha Event)|Legend Ticket]] and Metafilibuster's [[Talents]].

==Difficulty==
A fairly difficult sub-chapter that could easily get out of hand without the appropriate units, namely strong [[:Category:Behemoth Slayer Cats|Behemoth Slayers]]. Its only stage, a remake of the [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)|Filibuster Invasion]], comes with major improvements both to the main threat and his support.
{{LegendDiff|120}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 4 enemies to the main Legend Stages, though only 2 are entirely new:
*[[Metafilibuster (Enemy)|Metafilibuster]]: A pure [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Filibuster Obstructa]] with more health and damage, as well as immunity to [[Surge Attack]]s.
*[[Casaurian Ahirujo]]: A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] enemy first seen in the [[Behemoth Culling]] stages, with a three-part attack that increases by 50 range every hit and a 5% chance for a Savage Blow. Has a lot of pushing power and is pretty devastating overall when unprepared.
*[[Angelic Beast Rajakong]]: An [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/Behemoth enemy first seen in [[Empress' Excavation 2]], with over 1.8 million health, massive DPS, Omni Strikes that hit up to 250 range, and a 10% chance for a level 2 [[Wave Attack]].
*[[Ancient Magamojoe]]: A [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/Behemoth variant of Casaurian Ahirujo with even more health/damage, [[Curse]] on the third hit, and a 50% chance to create a level 2 Surge within a wide area.
This sub-chapter is also the first to drop Z-Materials, which are needed for [[Ototo Corps|Ototo]] to upgrade the [[Cat Base]]'s foundation and style.

