==Trivia==
*Zero Field's name may be derived from ''[[wikipedia:Zero-point field|zero-point field]]'', a term used in quantum field theory.
*Zero Field's map looks like a red version of [[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]] from the [[Cats of the Cosmos]] map.
*Prior to [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]] with the introduction of Materials Z, material drop rates were originally: 13% for Bricks, Feathers, Coal, Gold and Ammonite, 0% for Sprockets, Meteorite and Beast Bones and 33% for none.
*In [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]], Zero Field became the first [[Zero Legends]] sub-chapter to have 2-crown difficulty.

